  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "厝邊ê田園素材庫"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0mrlDWQ7ZtY?si=dgMjZbqUw-F7XgNc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>林芊妗</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">南投ê自然景緻hōo以早蹛外地ê我sù常siàu念。踮南投生活了後，tsit-má拜六禮拜若是好天tiānn-tiānn ē去厝附近ê田園散步。Tsia ê美國水松（『落羽松』）uì青色變kah黃gìm-gìm，koh轉變成紅色，tsit个散步ê習慣，阮lóng iáu維持。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">散步ê路線真濟，其中一條ài uì人徛家邊--a ê小路行--落-去，經過菜園就是一大phiàn水田。有tang時仔tī小路附近ē tn̄g著一隻漢草勇健ê烏狗叫做「滷肉」，m̄ bat--ê看著伊恐驚ē先tùn-tenn，m̄敢行倚。你若叫一聲「滷肉」，伊若有熟sāi，就有可能ē tuè你去散步。看伊田岸、草埔sì-kè nǹg，hānn過用枋仔做橋ê田溝，行tī阮頭前，ná像leh tshuā路，ke一个伴做伙行mā心適心適。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沿路阿母ē紹介各種植物hōo我認bat，bē輸是導覽。伊知影佗一欉檨仔逐年lóng ē生真厚，開拆荔枝kap龍眼樹葉無仝ê所在，桑材、時計果、菝仔、波羅蜜、甘蔗、各種菜蔬、芳花……一項一項報hōo我知，而且田岸邊--a ê小路按怎sio-thàng伊mā知知。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下晡行tsit爿ê田野散步，除了有五花十色ê花草植物thang欣賞，koh ē-sái看著日頭落山，雲尪kap日頭光beh暗仔ē變出百百款ê光彩，畫面suí kah人ē se̍h神。恬靜無偌久，田嬰、白翎鷥無意中tín動--一-下，kā神--去ê過路人khiú--tńg-來，繼續記錄自然美景ê路程。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">種種田園植物真適合做速寫素材，散步ê時，我ē想beh kā新奇、心適ê景緻記--落-來，無法度隨畫，就ē kā有興趣ê花草、樹木錄影--起-來、tńg去厝--裡沓沓仔欣賞。倚近看詳細，ē-tàng發現in ê造型、色水、大細、長短、sio疊ê方式偌nī豐富，斟酌去觀察了後，tsiah發覺以早看siunn淺--ah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄ê畫面內啥mi̍h beh留、啥mi̍h beh放，介在自我，莫怪人講「藝術家kánn-ná生活哲學家」。Tsia ê自然景緻實在hōo人看bē siān，仝款ê植物隨季節ê轉換，改變in ê妝thānn，就án-ne我心內ê素材庫永遠bē欠缺--ah。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXqiWRuTm3gU1FFX91zSR-uFVlN7_NXSHGR0iJYYjya7fGyGOeO5YxVPE6Wyef5CnNm7jz7D8TSGqIuWWIHoSmV3IpFYiGw0LBXNgTlBWNbJrsa5bLvL1uQO8nlqhwOXkmBNAEOjMh2Cry6PWWmPC6DfQnYwN2djWB8FPLRL3Xkwc4Nd0HXlYVhN76RHdo/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_34.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXqiWRuTm3gU1FFX91zSR-uFVlN7_NXSHGR0iJYYjya7fGyGOeO5YxVPE6Wyef5CnNm7jz7D8TSGqIuWWIHoSmV3IpFYiGw0LBXNgTlBWNbJrsa5bLvL1uQO8nlqhwOXkmBNAEOjMh2Cry6PWWmPC6DfQnYwN2djWB8FPLRL3Xkwc4Nd0HXlYVhN76RHdo/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1353%E6%9C%9F_34.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEite1hQ49Ng2M8LKboG32zd0sqsYxFCdyPxGCJ8npeWLzC8R8bJ6ptQU-iWK6C9qZhfMjCsB30eBwmbahF6lsyXlbvbEGfXFpT1E4_lG2ecRGGcg1-boZ4L5Lmgwt7WYIqfFPR_XCoGREByMQvRE2Uer2i5sq7eOK9TIDACWVjjxOZonMYAemGxV-f5U_1W/s1424/353%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img bor